          },
          "code": "CAREER_SITE_KEYWORD_BASED_ASSET_SELECTION",
          "id": "1769498164121",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769498164122_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Task:\nMatch the single most relevant AssetID for a given descriptive text by evaluating keyword relevance, domain alignment, and keyword consistency.\n\n# Input:\n- Descriptive Text: \" {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.description}} {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.suppliedKeywords}} \"\n- Items (formatted as JSON): {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.assetList}} (Each item contains an AssetID and associated keywords.)\n\n# Instructions:\n1. Parse the input JSON to extract AssetIDs and their corresponding keywords.\n2. Determine the primary domain of the descriptive text (e.g., technology, software, cloud, nature, design).\n3. Compare the descriptive text with the keywords for each AssetID using semantic similarity techniques -\n     - Strongly prioritize assets whose keywords predominantly align with the primary domain of the description.\n     - Penalize assets that include keywords unrelated or contradictory to the description’s domain (e.g., environmental, scenic, or nature terms when the description is technology-focused).\n     - Prefer assets where most keywords are relevant, not just one or two overlapping terms.\n4. If multiple assets appear similar, choose the one with:\n     - The highest concentration of domain-relevant keywords\n     - The fewest irrelevant or off-domain keywords\n5. Return the result in JSON format without altering the original keywords of any asset.\n\n# Output:\nOutput an RFC8259 compliant JSON object in the following format:\n{\n    \"AssetID\": \"chosen_asset_id\",\n    \"Explanation\": \"Reasoning behind the choice based on semantic similarity.\"\n}\n\nMULTILINGUAL OUTPUT ENFORCEMENT\n- All responses must be entirely in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}}\n- Translate all static or hardcoded text before output.\n- Do not use any other language except required proper nouns.\n- If {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}} is empty, default to English."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [],
